ality, Customer First, Innovation, Commitment -> /about", "35+ years experience -> /", "10K+ happy customers -> /", "4.9 average rating -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Wiesbrook Sheet Metal, Inc. was established with a vision to become the premier sheet metal contractor in Northeastern Illinois.", "founded_year": "1989", "employee_count": "50+", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='wiesbrook-sheet-metal-hvac' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
