UPDATE companies SET description='Wire Specialties operates as the North American distributor for Furukawa Electric, supplying triple-insulated winding wires for power supply and transformer applications. The company maintains its office in Amherst, New Hampshire, while its inventory ships from a warehouse in Atlanta, Georgia.

The firm’s product line centers on TEX-E triple-insulated winding wire, which is designed for compact transformer and power supply designs. The wire eliminates the need for margin or interlayer tapes, allowing engineers to reduce component volume by up to 50% and weight by up to 65% compared to conventional constructions.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Triple-insulated winding wire distribution", "TEX-E winding wire supply"], "industries": ["Power supplies", "Transformers"], "materials": ["Triple-insulated winding wire", "TEX-E winding wire"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["North American distributor for Furukawa Electric", "TEX-E triple-insulated winding wire eliminates margin and interlayer tapes", "Enables up to 50% volume reduction and 65% weight reduction in designs", "Ships from Atlanta, Georgia warehouse"], "facts_used": ["North American distributor for Furukawa Electric -> db", "Supplies triple-insulated winding wires for power supplies and transformers -> db", "Office located in Amherst, New Hampshire -> db", "Wires shipped from warehouse in Atlanta, Georgia -> db", "TEX-E winding wire ideal for compact transformer and power supply designs -> /", "TEX-E wire eliminates need for margin or interlayer tapes -> /", "Designs achieve 50% volume and 65% weight reductions -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We are the North American distributors for Furukawa Electric.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='wire-specialties' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Wire Wire Electric Supply, LLC operates from Toledo, Illinois, where President Tim Grissom leads a business built on 40 years of electrical industry experience. The company was established to provide a dependable supply of cable and wire to customers across the Lower 48 states, shipping from a central Illinois location.

The company functions as a distributor, sourcing from multiple wire manufacturers to stock a broad range of products including NM-B residential wire, UF-B direct burial cable, THHN/THWN-2 conduit wire, and flexible portable cords such as SOOW and SJOOW rubber cord. Orders over $100 and under 109 pounds ship free to the contiguous United States, while bulk orders are handled through custom quotes.

Its customer base spans the electrical industry, serving contractors, builders, and maintenance teams who need reliable access to copper wire and cable for residential, commercial, and industrial projects. The product catalog also includes specialized categories such as mining cable, medium voltage cable, and security and fire alarm wire.

