UPDATE companies SET description='WireFox Electric is an electrical services company based in Odenton, Maryland. Founded in 2018, the business is a family-owned operation whose owners have served the Odenton area for five generations. The company began as a local provider of residential and commercial electrical solutions, emphasizing up-front pricing and a satisfaction guarantee.

The company provides a range of electrical services including repairs, installations, and upgrades. Its offerings cover electrical wiring repairs, switch and outlet repairs, lighting and ceiling fan installations, EV charger installations, electrical panel upgrades, whole-home surge protection, and emergency electrical services. WireFox operates with licensed electricians available 24/7 and offers same-day service for urgent needs. The team serves thousands of homes across Odenton and surrounding communities such as Bowie, Columbia, Crofton, and Elkridge.

WireFox serves both residential homeowners and commercial clients. Typical projects include troubleshooting electrical issues, upgrading circuit breaker panels, installing EV charging stations, and performing electrical inspections for safety and efficiency.

WireFox differentiates itself through transparent, up-front pricing, a satisfaction guarantee, and rapid response times. The company highlights its five-generation local heritage, 24/7 emergency availability, and same-day service as key reasons customers choose them. All work is performed by licensed technicians who prioritize safety and cleanliness.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electrical repairs", "EV charger installation", "Lighting installation", "Ceiling fan installation", "Electrical panel upgrades", "Whole home surge protection", "Emergency electrical services", "Same-day service", "24/7 availability", "Electrical wiring repairs", "Electrical inspections", "Outlet installation", "Circuit breaker panel upgrades", "Switch and outlet repairs", "Troubleshooting", "Residential electrical services", "Commercial electrical services"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day service available; 24/7 emergency response", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Up-front pricing with no surprises", "Satisfaction guarantee on all work", "Same-day service for urgent electrical needs", "24/7 emergency response", "Five generations of local family ownership"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2018 -> db description", "Headquarters Odenton, MD -> db hq_city/hq_state_label", "Family-owned five generations -> homepage", "Services: electrical repairs, EV charger installs, lighting, panel upgrades, surge protection, emergency, same-day, 24/7 -> homepage", "Service area: Odenton, Bowie, Columbia, Crofton, Elkridge, etc. -> homepage", "Up-front pricing, satisfaction guarantee -> db description and homepage", "Licensed electricians -> homepage"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Wirefox Electric provides expert electrical services for both residential and commercial clients", "founded_year": "2018", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", 