gineering design, programming/testing & validation -> /", "Quality assurance & control, functional & electrical testing -> /", "Rework/modifications, bench testers -> /", "Reverse engineering & schematic build -> /", "In-field operation support -> /", "Turnkey assembly with materials procurement -> /", "Pick-up and drop-off services -> /", "Industries: industrial, heavy construction equipment, automotive, aerospace, medical, battery, marine, motorsports, military -> /", "Customers: OEMs, Tier 1 suppliers, Tier 2 suppliers, startups -> /", "24-hour turnaround, 2 weeks standard -> /", "Price-beat guarantee -> /", "60-day workmanship warranty -> /", "IPC-certified -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Wired Technologies is an IPC-certified full-service, single-source supplier. Our headquarters and manufacturing are located in Livonia, Michigan, with a 3,500-square-foot facility.", "founded_year": "2017", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='wired-technologies' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Wires R Us Inc. is an electrical contractor based in Piedmont, South Dakota, serving the Black Hills region since 1999. The company was founded by Donahue Williamson, who started the business with a van and his nephew to create stability for his growing family. Now a second-generation family-owned operation, it continues to operate on the core values of efficiency, cleanliness, reliability, and craftsmanship established at its inception.

The firm specializes in residential new construction and multi-family electrical wiring, handling projects from rough-in to finish with a focus on clean, organized job sites. Its service portfolio includes electrical service upgrades (100A, 200A, 400A), panel swaps, lighting upgrades, EV charger installations, standby generator installation and maintenance, and hot tub wiring. A distinctive offering is 3D-mapped wiring, where every wire is scanned and logged for future reference. The company also takes on select commercial projects.

Primary customers are tract home builders, developers, and general contractors who require consistent scheduling and code-compliant work across the Black Hills, including Rapid City, Spearfish, Sturgis, Belle Fourche, Hot Springs, and surrounding communities. The company also serves homeowners for specific installations such as EV chargers, service upgrades, and generator systems, and works with vacation rental property owners in areas like Deadwood and Lead to install automatic standby generators.

Williamson launched the business after identifying a need for a reliable electrical contractor that showed up on time, communicated well, and took pride in doing things the right way. The company emphasizes making projects run smoother for general contractors through organized systems that reduce mistakes, speed timelines, and eliminate coordination headaches. Its core values—leaving job sites clean, showing up on schedule, and delivering quality efficient work—are cited as the reason builders maintain long-term relationships.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Residential new construction wiring", "Multi-family electrical work", "Service upgrades (100A/200A/400A)", "Panel swaps", "Lighting upgrades", "EV charger installations", "Generator installation and maintenance", "Hot tub wiring", "3D-mapped wiring documentation", "Commercial electrical projects", "Financing coordination via Affirm"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Multi-family housing development", "Commercial construction", "Homeowner electrical services", "Vacation rental property management"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["3D-mapped wiring documentation for every project", "Clean job sites left better than found", "On-time scheduling with proactive communication", "Financing available via Affirm for generator and EV charger installations", "Second-generation family ownership with consistent core values"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1999 by Donahue Williamson -> /about-us", "Second-generation family-owned -> /about-us", "Headquarters in Piedmont, SD -> db", "Specializes in residential new construction and multi-family electrical -> /about-us", "Services include panel upgrades, EV chargers, generators -> /", "Installs Briggs & Stratton and Generac generators -> /", "Offers financing through Affirm -> /", "3D-mapped wiring -> /", "Serves Black Hills region including Rapid City, Spearfish, Sturgis -> /about-us", "Core values: clean job sites, on-time scheduling -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Wires R Us is a professional, reliable, and efficient electrical contractor that delivers work cleaner, faster, and with higher quality than most competitors.", "founded_year": "1999", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='wires-r-us-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
