UPDATE companies SET description='In January 2015, ownership transferred to his wife, Lydiann Lengacher, who had been involved in operations; she now serves as Manager and Partnership Representative. The business is certified as a Woman-Owned Business Enterprise.

The company designs, engineers, and fabricates precision fixtures, casework, and millwork for commercial interiors. Its production facility in rural Indiana combines traditional craftsmanship with modern manufacturing, including CNC machining, laminating, edge banding, finishing, and integration of materials such as acrylic, aluminum, Corian, glass, laminate, marble, melamine, metal, mirror, plastic, plywood, quartz, and steel. Services extend to 3D design, prototyping, high-volume manufacturing, project management, installation support, warehousing, and logistics, with shipments across all 50 states and into Canada.

Wood Technologies serves retail, hospitality, healthcare, corporate, and airport environments. Its client base includes general contractors, architects, designers, and corporate end users. Notable projects referenced include work for Tempur Pedic, Krewe Eyewear, Serena & Lily, and LaGuardia Airport.

The company emphasizes end-to-end expertise—design, engineering, fabrication, finishing, and logistics under one roof—to reduce handoffs and ensure consistent quality. Its woman-owned status is highlighted as a diversity asset for government and corporate projects, and it cites a proven track record of on-time, on-budget delivery for multi-location rollouts.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["3D Design & Modeling", "Acrylic Integration", "Aluminum Integration", "CNC Machining", "Corian Integration", "Custom Wood Molding & Trim", "Edgebanding (Straight & Contour)", "Exhibition & Booth Design/Fabrication", "Finished Carpentry", "Glass Integration", "High-Volume Manufacturing", "In-House Upholstery", "Installation Service Management", "International Shipping", "Laminate Integration", "Logistics Support", "Marble Integration", "Melamine Integration", "Metal Plating", "Mirror Integration", "On-Site Material Warehousing", "Painting", "Powder Coating", "Project Management"], "industries": ["Retail", "Hospitality", "Healthcare", "Corporate", "Airports"], "materials": ["Wood", "Acrylic", "Aluminum", "Corian", "Glass", "Laminate", "Marble", "Melamine", "Metal", "Mirror", "Plastic", "Plywood", "Quartz", "Steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Certified Woman-Owned Business Enterprise", "End-to-end design, engineering, fabrication, finishing, and logistics under one roof", "Nationwide delivery across all 50 states and into Canada", "Decades of experience with retail, healthcare, hospitality, and airport projects", "Rigorous inspection, finish-matching, and packaging for flawless installation"], "facts_used": ["Founded January 25, 2001 in Grabill, Indiana -> /about-us", "Founder Benjamin; ownership transferred to Lydiann Lengacher in January 2015 -> /about-us", "Lydiann Lengacher serves as Manager and Partnership Representative -> /about-us", "Certified Woman-Owned Business Enterprise -> /about-us, db",