UPDATE companies SET description='Wood and Water MN operates from Lauderdale, Minnesota, where founder Ashley Mellgren established the business after graduating college and acquiring her own workshop. Mellgren, who grew up around construction, traces her passion for making things by hand to a high school woodworking class where she built a bookcase for her parents.

The company produces custom wall art, furniture, and a variety of decorative odds and ends. Every piece is made from scratch and hand cut using various saws and hand tools; the shop does not use laser cutters. Offerings include pallet signs, seasonal signs, Minnesota-themed decor, lake signs, coffee tables, wine racks, headboards, bed frames, kitchen islands, barn doors, corn hole boards, and custom business logo signs.

The business emphasizes a collaborative approach, inviting customers to request any custom woodwork they can imagine.

Mellgren started the venture to fulfill a lifelong desire to make anything and everything she could, and the company differentiates itself by insisting on fully handcrafted, from-scratch production without laser cutting.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom wall art fabrication", "Custom signage production", "Custom furniture manufacturing", "Hand-cut woodworking", "Barn door fabrication", "Corn hole board fabrication", "Custom decor fabrication"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["All products made from scratch and hand cut with saws\u2014no laser cutters", "Custom fabrication of any concept the customer envisions", "Focus on one-of-a-kind, handcrafted wood decor and furniture"], "facts_used": ["Founder Ashley Mellgren -> db", "Headquarters Lauderdale, Minnesota -> db", "Founded after college when she got her own workshop -> /", "Hand-cut fabrication with various saws, no laser cutters -> /", "Product categories: wall art, furniture, odds & ends -> /", "Custom business logo signs -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Wood + Water takes pride in the fact that everything is made from scratch and hand cut with various saws and other tools\u2014no laser cutters.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='wood-and-water-mn' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='WoodLab operates from Eagle, Idaho, where it was founded in 2017 as a homegrown woodshop. The company began by crafting custom furniture from locally rescued urban wood, serving the Boise area and the broader Treasure Valley.

The shop handcrafts solid wood and epoxy river tables, custom art pieces, and ready-to-ship furniture. Its processes include live-edge slab selection, epoxy casting in colors such as multi-grey and dolphin grey, and concealed hardware installation that leaves no visible fasteners. An interactive online design tool lets customers specify wood species, epoxy color, leg style, and dimensions for a base price estimate. Finished pieces ship nationwide via LTL freight and internationally.

Customers range from residential buyers to commercial clients outfitting boardrooms and conference rooms. The product line includes dining tables, coffee tables, charcuterie boards, and wall art sculptures. WoodLab serves the Treasure Valley locally while fulfilling orders across the United States and overseas.

