UPDATE companies SET description='WorkbenchRVA operates as a public woodworking shop in Richmond, Virginia. The business was founded by Dalton, a lifelong woodworker who first discovered the craft in middle school. After working at a cabinet shop under mentor Mike Sibley, owner of Sibley''s Custom Cabinetry, Dalton developed the concept for a membership-based facility while completing a college business course with guidance from Professor Dr. James Haug. The venture launched to address the loss of school woodshop programs and the lack of accessible shop space for children and adults alike.

The facility provides 24/7 access to a fully operational cabinet shop equipped with table saws, jointers, and planers. Members receive project storage, discounted lumber, and a free orientation. Beyond shop access, WorkbenchRVA offers woodworking classes, kids workshops, tool-basics sessions, and private one-on-one instruction — all open to non-members. A retail area stocks hardwoods, softwoods, exotic woods, sandpaper, and finishes. The company also accepts custom woodworking commissions for homes and businesses.

The shop serves hobbyists, beginners, weekend warriors, and families seeking creative outlets, as well as small businesses needing custom woodwork. Classes and kids programs are designed for participants without prior experience, emphasizing a welcoming, grade-free environment.

Dalton started WorkbenchRVA to give people — especially children — the space, tools, and instruction that schools no longer provide. The goal is to foster creativity and hands-on learning in a fun, supportive community setting.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom woodworking", "Woodworking classes", "Kids woodworking workshops", "Tool basics training", "Private one-on-one instruction", "Membership-based shop access", "Lumber and supplies sales", "Project storage"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Hardwoods", "Softwoods", "Exotic woods", "Sandpaper", "Finishes"], "equipment": ["Table saws", "Jointers", "Planers"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24/7 shop access for members", "Project storage included with memberships", "Discounted lumber for members", "Classes and kids workshops open to non-members", "Lumber yard with hardwoods, softwoods, and exotics on site"], "facts_used": ["Location: Richmond, Virginia -> /about-us", "Founder: Dalton (first name) -> /about-us", "Business model: Membership-based public woodshop with 24/7 access -> /", "Equipment: Table saws, jointers, planers -> /about-us", "Services: Custom woodworking, classes, kids workshops, tool basics, private lessons -> /, /services", "Materials: Hardwoods, softwoods, exotic woods, sandpaper, finishes -> /", "Origin story: Dalton''s passion since middle school, mentor Mike Sibley, professor Dr. James Haug -> /about-us", "Mission: Provide creative outlet and woodworking education due to school program cuts -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Other", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "WorkbenchRVA is a Public Shop Space located in Richmond, Virginia.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='workbenchrva' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
