UPDATE companies SET description='Xtreme Fabrication operates from a 30,000-square-foot facility on five acres in Leitchfield, Kentucky. The company employs 20 people and holds ISO 9001:2015 and AS9100D certifications.

The shop specializes in custom metal fabrication, offering MIG, TIG, and stick welding; CNC plasma and laser cutting up to 1-inch thickness; CNC pipe and tube bending up to 2-inch schedule 40 pipe; CNC press brake forming up to 350 tons and 12-foot length; CNC shearing; precision sawing with a Cosen automatic mitering saw; and CNC machining on five centers for runs of one to 4,000 pieces.

