UPDATE companies SET description='Xtreme Manufacturing is headquartered in Henderson, Nevada. Founded in 2003 by Don Ahern, the company originated from his dissatisfaction with telehandlers available for his rental fleet. After purchasing Western Attachments Company in 1999, an Oregon-based forklift maker, Ahern rebranded it as Xtreme Manufacturing in 2003 and relocated to Nevada.

The company designs and manufactures rough-terrain telescopic handlers (telehandlers) with 24 models spanning lifting capacities from 5,900 to 100,000 pounds and maximum lift heights up to 100 feet. It also produces Xtreme Cubes, a line of portable modular buildings for commercial, residential, and temporary uses. All assembly and engineering operations are conducted at its Henderson facility.

Xtreme serves construction, industrial, oil-and-gas, mining, and rental markets, as well as customers needing modular structures for offices, retail, workforce housing, restaurants, and trade-show booths.

Ahern started the business to build a more reliable telehandler using high-quality components that lower total cost of ownership. The company emphasizes features such as boom rollers instead of wear pads, 360-degree cab visibility, intuitive one-hand controls, and an integrated boom lift point. It backs products with a 10-year/5-year/2-year warranty and notes that all units are built in North America.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Telehandler design and manufacturing", "Modular building design and manufacturing (Xtreme Cubes)", "Engineering and R&D", "Assembly and fabrication", "Parts distribution and technical support", "Warranty service and activation", "Financing facilitation"], "industries": ["Construction", "Industrial", "Oil and gas", "Mining", "Equipment rental", "Commercial construction (office, retail)", "Residential construction", "Hospitality (quick-serve restaurants)", "Events and trade shows"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["XR7038 telehandler", "XR1570 telehandler", "XRM945 telehandler", "XR2034 telehandler", "XR4030 telehandler", "XR6538 telehandler", "Xtreme Cubes modular buildings", "E-Z Loader truck bed"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Boom rollers instead of wear pads for smooth, low-maintenance boom operation", "360\u00b0 operator visibility from the cab", "Intuitive controls allowing one hand on the steering wheel at all times", "Integrated boom lift point rated for maximum machine capacity", "Industry-leading 10-year/5-year/2-year warranty on all products"], "facts_used": ["Headquartered in Henderson, Nevada -> /about-us", "Founded in 2003 by Don Ahern -> /about-us", "Originated from dissatisfaction with telehandlers for rental fleet -> /about-us", "Purchased Western Attachments Company in 1999 -> /about-us", "Rebranded to Xtreme Manufacturing in 2003 -> /about-us", "Offers 24 telehandler models with capacities 5,900\u2013100,000 lbs -> /about-us", "Maximum lift heights up to 100