UPDATE companies SET description='Yes Solar Solutions was founded in 2009 by co-owners Stew and Kathy Miller in Cary, North Carolina. The locally owned and operated firm holds an unlimited North Carolina general contractor''s license and an electrical license, allowing it to manage every aspect of solar projects in-house.

Its NABCEP-accredited team has completed more than 2,500 installations across the state.

Customers include homeowners, businesses, nonprofits, municipalities, and government agencies throughout North Carolina. Notable projects include a 30.36 kW system for Triangle Family Services and a 101.65 kW installation at Pinehurst Medical Clinic. The firm also assists clients with tax credits, REAP grants, and utility incentive programs.

