UPDATE companies SET description='Zenergy Solar & Roofing operates from Wilmington, Delaware, where it was founded in 2005 as a small company focused on helping homeowners reduce energy costs. The business has grown over roughly two decades into a full-service home upgrade contractor serving the Mid-Atlantic region.

The company designs and installs residential solar arrays, battery storage systems, EV chargers, roofing, HVAC and heat-pump equipment, insulation, and smart-home controls. Each project begins with a free home energy audit that uses thermal imaging, blower-door testing, drone roof scans, and water testing to produce a custom scope of work. In-house crews carry out all installations, and the firm coordinates permitting, inspections, and utility interconnection.

Zenergy serves homeowners throughout Delaware (Wilmington, Newark, Dover), southern New Jersey (Cherry Hill, Marlton, Mount Laurel, Willingboro, Brick), and eastern Pennsylvania (Philadelphia suburbs and the PECO territory).

Leadership says the business was started out of an obsession with saving homeowners money and a commitment to finishing every job to a single standard. The firm emphasizes one coordinated team, premium materials such as GAF shingles and tier-1 solar panels from Tesla, Generac, Q CELLS, and Silfab, on-time completion, and 24/7 system monitoring backed by workmanship and product warranties.', certifications=ARRAY['GAF Certified Roofer','Delaware state licensed','Franklin WH Certified installer']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Residential solar panel installation", "Home battery storage installation (Franklin WH)", "EV charging station installation", "Roofing installation and repair (architectural shingles, metal)", "Solar panel removal and replacement", "HVAC and heat pump installation and repair", "Home energy audit (thermal imaging, blower door, drone scan, water test)", "Insulation installation (spray foam, blown-in, attic sealing)", "Smart thermostat and energy monitoring installation", "Permitting and utility interconnection coordination"], "industries": ["Residential solar", "Residential roofing", "Residential HVAC", "Home energy efficiency", "Residential insulation"], "materials": ["Tier-1 solar panels (Tesla, Generac, Q CELLS, Silfab)", "Franklin WH whole-home battery storage", "GAF architectural shingles", "Metal roofing", "Heat pumps and AC units", "Spray foam insulation", "Blown-in insulation", "Smart thermostats"], "equipment": ["Drone for roof scanning", "Thermal imaging camera", "Blower door test equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Site survey typically within 48 hours; full project completion in a few weeks", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Free, no-obligation home energy audit with thermal imaging and drone roof scan", "Same-day quotes in most cases", "$0-down financing options through multiple lending partners", "In-house installation crews for solar, roofing, HVAC, and insulation", "24/7 system monitoring with workmanship and product warranties"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2005 -> db", "Headquarters Wilmington, Delaware -> db", "Services: solar, storage, roofing, HVAC, insulation, energy audits -> /", "Service area: DE, southern NJ, eastern PA with specific cities -> /", "BBB accredited -> /", "GAF Certified Roofer -> /", "Tier-1 equipment brands: Tesla, Generac, Q CELLS, Silfab -> /", "Franklin WH battery storage -> /", "Financing partners: Sungage, Sunnova, EnerGize, Lightreach -> /", "In-house crews -> /", "Free home energy audit with thermal imaging, blower door, drone scan, water test -> /", "Same-day quotes -> /", "24/7 monitoring -> /", "Workmanship + product warranties -> /", "Leadership started company obsessed with saving homeowners money -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Zenergy Solar designs and installs premium solar panels and home battery backup across New Jersey, Pennsylvania & Delaware.", "founded_year": "2005", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='zenergy-solar-roofing' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Zongkers Custom Woods Inc was founded in 1989 by brothers Dennis and Dan Zongker in Omaha, Nebraska.

The company manufactures premium, handcrafted fine furniture and cabinetry, producing each piece individually with an artist''s signature to guarantee authenticity. Its capabilities span custom design, engineering drawings, finish sampling, and detailing, with specialties in hand-carving, marquetry veneer inlays, curved furniture, and specialty finishes. The shop serves both commercial and residential projects, fabricating conference tables, reception desks, workstations, dining sets, kitchen cabinetry, entertainment centers, bedroom suites, and liturgical furnishings.

