UPDATE companies SET description='ePac Flexible Packaging operates its Los Angeles-area manufacturing facility in Chino, California, which opened in 2019. The site is part of ePac Holdings, LLC, a network of locally equipped flexible packaging plants. The Chino location serves brands throughout Southern California with full-service production capabilities.

