UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Maple Grove, Minnesota, 4C Medical Technologies, Inc. develops minimally invasive technologies for structural heart disease. The company focuses on transcatheter mitral valve replacement, though its founding year and ownership structure have not been publicly disclosed.

