UPDATE companies SET description='A&H Manufacturing Worldwide, based in Johnston, Rhode Island, traces its roots to 1967 when jewelry salesman H. Jack Feibelman invented the hanging jewelry card, a design that became an industry standard. The company remained under Feibelman family leadership until 2022, when ownership transitioned to the Calandrelli family—Anthony and Daniel Calandrelli—who bring decades of packaging experience and continue the founder''s legacy of customer-focused innovation.

The company designs, engineers, and manufactures custom product packaging across four facilities worldwide. Its capabilities span carding, hang tags and tickets, boxes, labels, e-commerce packaging, molded specialty items, gift packaging, eco-friendly solutions, puff pads, and pouches. In-house design, engineering, and research teams handle projects from concept through production and delivery, serving both large retailers and smaller brands.

A&H serves a diverse client base that includes the world''s largest retailers as well as businesses in jewelry, apparel, accessories, tools, hardware, and wine. The firm''s packaging solutions are tailored to each product category, with an emphasis on brand storytelling and functional fit.

Feibelman''s original insight—"When you can''t find what you''re looking for, you invent it"—still drives the company''s approach. A&H differentiates itself through Made-in-USA production that reduces transportation emissions, a sustainability program that re-engineers packages to use less material, and a customer service model built on timely communication and creative problem-solving.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom packaging design", "Carding", "Hang tags and tickets", "Box manufacturing", "Label production", "E-commerce packaging", "Molded specialty packaging", "Gift packaging", "Eco-friendly packaging", "Puff pads", "Pouches"], "industries": ["Retail", "Jewelry", "Apparel", "Accessories", "Tools", "Hardware", "Wine"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Four global facilities enabling flexible speed, cost, or quality priorities", "Made in USA manufacturing reducing transportation emissions", "Eco-friendly packaging via package re-engineering and sustainable materials", "In-house design, engineering, and R&D for custom solutions", "Customer service team focused on timely updates and creative solutions"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1967 by H. Jack Feibelman -> /about-us", "Headquartered in Johnston, Rhode Island -> db", "Four facilities worldwide -> /about-us", "Custom packaging capabilities: carding, tags, boxes, labels, e-commerce, molded specialty, gift, eco-friendly, puff pads, pouches -> /about-us", "Serves retail, jewelry, clothing, accessories, tools, hardware, wine industries -> /about-us", "Transitioned to Calandrelli family ownership in 2022 -> /about-us", "Made in USA packaging solutions -> /about-us", "Eco-friendly packaging through re-engineering -> /", "In-house design, engineering, R&D teams -> /about-us", "Customer service team emphasis -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We are product packaging architects. We design, engineer, and manufacture packaging for many of the world''s most successful retail brands.", "founded_year": "1967", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='a-h-manufacturing-co' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='A & L Furniture operates from Rebersburg, Pennsylvania, where it produces a family of furniture brands. The company does not disclose its founding year or the names of its founders, and its ownership structure is not publicly specified.

The company manufactures a wide range of indoor and outdoor furniture under several brand names. Versaloft offers beds, bunkbeds, loft beds, mission beds, trundle beds, and drawer beds. Unique Hickory Furniture produces dining tables, chairs, bar stools, rockers, gliders, coffee tables, end tables, desks, and porch swings using hand-selected hickory. Bryton Park specializes in outdoor furniture made from eco-friendly recycled plastic poly lumber, including chairs, tables, stools, rockers, benches, side tables, porch swings, daybeds, bar tables, bistro sets, and picnic tables. Blue Mountain Live Edge works with durable, rot-resistant live edge locust hardwood for porch swings, flower pot benches, outdoor chairs, side tables, coffee tables, Ridgemont tables and benches, and picnic tables. Cedar Canyon builds outdoor cedar furniture such as pergolas, picnic tables, benches, swings, gliders, Adirondack chairs, and tables. Processes emphasize handmade construction, hand-selection of materials, and finishing in various colors and stains. No facility size, headcount, production volumes, or part numbers are disclosed.

